      "section_number": "328",
      "title": "Succession of one firm by another firm.",
      "text": "Where a firm carrying on a business or profession is succeeded by another firm, except in a case covered by section 327, separate assessments shall be made on the predecessor firm and the successor firm as per the provisions of section 313.",
